# Aura Components Public Stewardship Licence

Copyright (c) Luke Hayes / Aura of Intelligence. All rights reserved except as allowed below.

This is a plain-language stewardship licence for the Aura Components public repository. It is written for an exploratory Aura interface and component workbench, not as a generic software product licence.

## 1. What This Repo Is

This repository contains Aura Components, including the Aura Builder, avatar builder, timeline, memory palace, social media intelligence, algorithm marketplace, file storage, IoT interface concepts, page code, visual design, labels, workflows and related interface material.

Nothing in this repo should be treated as finished security, privacy, encryption, scheduling, data-governance, crypto, legal, financial, medical or production infrastructure unless Luke Hayes explicitly says so.

## 2. Non-Commercial Public Use

You may view, share links to, clone, study, reference and adapt this repo for personal, community, educational, artistic, research, public-interest or other non-commercial purposes.

This includes learning from the Aura interface patterns, adapting component structures for your own non-commercial work, and using the repo as inspiration for public-interest tools.

When practical, please credit Aura of Intelligence and Luke Hayes, and link back to the original project:

https://github.com/auraofintelligence/aura-components

## 3. Commercial Rights Reserved

All commercial rights are reserved to Luke Hayes / Aura of Intelligence.

You may not sell, monetise, repackage, licence, sponsor, advertise with, merchandise, commercially publish, commercially distribute, commercially train systems on, or commercially exploit Aura Components without written permission.

This includes, but is not limited to:

- the Aura Components name, interface patterns, field models and builder workflows
- the Aura of Intelligence name, brand, visual language and related narrative materials
- paid dashboards, commercial templates, SaaS products, client services, courses, data products, programmable agents, crypto actions or commercial infrastructure derived from this repo
- screenshots, generated assets, page copy, builder workflows, data models, docs, demos or close copies of the interface

Commercial use requires written permission from Luke Hayes.

## 4. User Data And Local Outputs

Where the components allow local state, exports or user-created records, Aura Components claims no ownership over records you create for yourself.

You are responsible for what you put into the tools, what you export, and where you share it.

Do not use this public prototype to store secrets, private keys, medical records, legal records, passwords, production credentials or other sensitive material.

## 5. Code, Forms And Component Structures

The code, interface forms and component structures are shared so people can learn from the approach and adapt it for non-commercial creative, educational, research or public-interest work.

If you improve the public infrastructure, fix bugs, or develop useful patterns from it, please share useful notes, fixes or improvements back to the commons where reasonable.

Do not sell this repo, its templates, its builder systems, or close copies of its planning, interface or mapping infrastructure as a standalone product.

## 6. Honest Provenance

If you adapt non-commercial parts of this repo, keep the provenance clear.

Do not remove attribution in a way that makes the work look like it originated elsewhere. Do not use the Aura of Intelligence name, logo, language, screenshots or planning material to imply endorsement, partnership, sponsorship or approval without written permission.

## 7. Harmful Or Deceptive Use

You may not use this repo or its material for deceptive, exploitative, aggressive, hateful, harassing, unsafe or harmful purposes.

You may not use the material to mislead people about privacy, security, encryption, law, finance, health, public events, public safety, programmable actions, crypto systems or current events.

## 8. Third-Party Material

Any third-party libraries, browser APIs, fonts or externally hosted packages keep their own licences.

This licence does not remove any rights that third-party authors already grant under their own licences.

## 9. No Warranty

This repo is provided as-is.

Luke Hayes and Aura of Intelligence make no warranties and accept no liability for how you choose to use, adapt, interpret, deploy or rely on this material.

Build wisely, keep provenance clear, and do not treat these prototypes as finished privacy-preserving systems.
